    <briefdescription>
<para>Class that manages the creation of a lock file to aid implicit coordination between different processes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The implicit coordination works by creating a &quot;.lock&quot; file alongside the file that we&apos;re coordinating for, using the atomicity of the file system to ensure that only a single process can create that &quot;.lock&quot; file. When the lock file is removed, the owning process has finished the operation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
